skilletor: nope@shared is not declared in the user config (${HOME}/.claude/skilletor.json); the wildcards skill:*@shared, rule:*@shared there installs every matching item of its type from shared, so if shared offers it: uninstall the wildcard (skilletor uninstall 'skill:*@shared' or skilletor uninstall 'rule:*@shared'), or keep it and gate the item via vars if its template renders empty for some value (an empty render is skipped).
